==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|пятьно|gloss=brand, sign}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*pętьno|gloss=trace, sign}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*pęta|gloss=heel}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|sla-pro|*stopa||foot; footstep, footprint, trace}}; {{m+|grc|πτέρνη||heel; hoof; heel of a shoe; footstep; …}}; {{m+|la|vestīgium||footprint, track; trace, vestige, mark, sign; sole of the foot; horseshoe; …}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пятно́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-пятно.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|пятно́|*|dim=пя́тнышко}}

# [[spot]], [[mark]]
# [[blot]], [[blemish]], [[stain]]
# {{lb|ru|by extension}} [[blemish]], [[stain]] {{gloss|a defamatory fact}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|d|пятно́|*}}

